{"seq":3,"slug":"promo-compliance-monitor","title":"促销合规监控与巡检","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-claim-promo-compliance/claim-governance-risk/promo-compliance-monitor","wordCount":2551,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"促销合规监控与巡检\">促销合规监控与巡检</h1><p>发布闸管的是「还没发出去的东西」，这一篇管的是「已经发出去的东西」。两者不可互相替代，原因很具体：闸门的判定基于提交时刻的上下文，而展示是持续的——前价窗口在滚动，规则在升级，素材在渠道侧被改动，A/B 实验会把合规素材换成不合规变体。所以<strong>已发布内容的合规状态是时间相关的</strong>，一次通过不等于永久通过。</p>\n<p>巡检要回答三类问题：展示出来的价格与当时判定的价格一致吗；正在展示的素材是否命中当前生效的规则；以及整体违规率是多少、趋势如何。三类问题的取数方式、频率与判定逻辑不同，混在一起做会既慢又不准。这一篇给出巡检的抽样与全量策略、价格展示的自动核查方法、违规率指标的定义，以及巡检结果如何回流成规则修订。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>巡检的输入是<strong>已发布的展示事实</strong>，这个事实有两个来源：你自己系统的展示流水（第一章第二篇定义的 <code>promo_display_log</code>、第三章第二篇定义的 <code>gate_decision</code>），以及<strong>外部渠道实际展示的页面</strong>。两个来源必须分别检查，因为两者可能不一致——渠道侧可能缓存了旧价格、平台可能改了你的素材、页面渲染可能与你的数据不符。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[巡检调度] --&gt; B[内部比对&lt;br/&gt;展示流水 vs 价格流水]&#10;  A --&gt; C[外部取数&lt;br/&gt;抓取/平台 API]&#10;  B --&gt; D{前价是否仍合规?}&#10;  C --&gt; E{页面展示&lt;br/&gt;是否与判定一致?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[告警 + 自动降级展示]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[告警 + 人工确认]&#10;  F --&gt; H[违规事件]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  A --&gt; I[规则重放&lt;br/&gt;已发布素材 vs 当前规则]&#10;  I --&gt; J{命中阻断规则?}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| K[待复核队列]&#10;  H --&gt; L[违规率指标]&#10;  K --&gt; L&#10;  L --&gt; M{超阈值?}&#10;  M --&gt;|是| N[规则修订 / 流程改造]&#10;  N --&gt; O[规则版本发布]\">graph TD\n  A[巡检调度] --&gt; B[内部比对&lt;br/&gt;展示流水 vs 价格流水]\n  A --&gt; C[外部取数&lt;br/&gt;抓取/平台 API]\n  B --&gt; D{前价是否仍合规?}\n  C --&gt; E{页面展示&lt;br/&gt;是否与判定一致?}\n  D --&gt;|否| F[告警 + 自动降级展示]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[告警 + 人工确认]\n  F --&gt; H[违规事件]\n  G --&gt; H\n  A --&gt; I[规则重放&lt;br/&gt;已发布素材 vs 当前规则]\n  I --&gt; J{命中阻断规则?}\n  J --&gt;|是| K[待复核队列]\n  H --&gt; L[违规率指标]\n  K --&gt; L\n  L --&gt; M{超阈值?}\n  M --&gt;|是| N[规则修订 / 流程改造]\n  N --&gt; O[规则版本发布]</pre><h3 id=\"内部比对与外部取数\">内部比对与外部取数</h3><p><strong>内部比对</strong>是把展示流水与价格流水对齐，重算前价并检查展示的折扣是否仍然成立。它便宜、可全量、可高频。典型的不合规形态是价格回滚后展示未同步：商品在 10 月 1 日以 249 元展示，10 月 20 日价格调回 299 元，但展示的划线价仍是 249——此时展示的「原价 249」已经不再是窗口内最低价（更低的价格实际存在过），继续展示构成不实。内部比对能在几秒内发现这类问题。</p>\n<p><strong>外部取数</strong>是抓取渠道实际展示的页面或调用平台 API 读取商品状态。这一层的必要性来自一个已经确立的事实：环境类宣称的合规性取决于<strong>消费者实际看到的那个媒介</strong>，同一句「环保」在包装上是泛泛宣称、在网页上附了具体化说明才可能被接受——所以判定与巡检都必须以实际展示为准，不能只看自己库里的素材（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32024L0825\">Directive (EU) 2024/825</a>）。它贵、只能抽样、有频率限制，但它能发现内部比对看不见的问题：渠道缓存导致的价格不一致、平台侧对素材的修改、以及跳转落地页与广告素材不符（这是一个高频违规类型——广告里的价格与落地页的价格不一致）。</p>\n<p>抽样的分配应当按风险加权而不是均匀随机：新上线的素材、命中过高风险规则后放行的素材、以及曾经违规的责任方产出的素材，都应当有更高的抽样率。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查类型</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>覆盖率</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n<th>能发现的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内部价格比对</td>\n<td>展示流水 + 价格流水</td>\n<td>全量</td>\n<td>每小时</td>\n<td>价格回滚后展示未同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部规则重放</td>\n<td>已发布素材 + 当前规则</td>\n<td>全量</td>\n<td>规则发布时</td>\n<td>规则升级后的存量违规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部页面取数</td>\n<td>抓取/平台 API</td>\n<td>加权抽样</td>\n<td>每日</td>\n<td>缓存不一致、平台改素材、落地页不符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全渠道价格抽查</td>\n<td>多市场多渠道</td>\n<td>分层抽样</td>\n<td>每周</td>\n<td>跨市场一致性、汇率与含税口径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"规则重放-规则升级后的存量处理\">规则重放：规则升级后的存量处理</h3><p>规则升级时，已经通过闸门的素材需要重新判定——这是「规则升级后旧素材怎么办」的正面回答。做法是把已发布素材集合与规则集快照重新求值。这份重放不必立刻重新判定全部历史素材（成本极高且大部分不会命中），可行的优化是<strong>只重放规则差异部分</strong>：计算新旧规则版本的差集，只对差集内的规则做求值。</p>\n<p>重放结果的处置要分级：命中阻断规则且仍在展示的素材，立即进待复核队列并通知责任方，同时可以自动降级展示（例如隐藏划线价、替换为无宣称的通用文案）以止损；命中告警级的只记录。这一条与第二章第三篇的绿色宣称禁令结合时尤其重要——2026 年 9 月 27 日之后，此前合规的泛泛环保宣称全部翻转为违规，重放能一次性找出全部存量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落地页一致性\">落地页一致性</h2><p>广告素材与落地页不符是一类独立的违规，且来源经常不在营销系统里（落地页由商品系统渲染，素材由营销系统生成）。检查方法很简单：取出素材里声明的关键事实（价格、折扣率、宣称关键词），与落地页实际渲染出的对应事实做比对。三个高频不一致：素材写的折扣率与落地页计算的不一致（两边用了不同的前价计算口径）；素材里的宣称在落地页不存在（落地页没跟上素材更新）；落地页有素材没有的隐藏条件（例如「需会员」「限新用户」，属于实质性信息遗漏）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"违规率指标\">违规率指标</h2><p>巡检的价值最终落在一个可比较的指标上。定义不清的「违规率」会变成无法行动的数字，所以需要把它拆成可归因的几层。</p>\n<p>设某市场在某期间内巡检的展示实例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，其中判定为违规的为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>，则展示违规率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = V / N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。这个数字单独看没有意义，必须同时给出四个分解：</p>\n<p><strong>按来源分解</strong>：内部价格不一致、外部展示不一致、规则重放命中、落地页不符。四个来源对应四个不同的修复团队，混在一起的数字无法派活。</p>\n<p><strong>按严重度分解</strong>：阻断级（构成明确的虚假宣传）与告警级（执行较松市场的绝对化用语）。用加权违规率可以压缩成一个数：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_w = \\sum_s w_s V_s / N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，权重按市场罚则强度设定。</p>\n<p><strong>按责任方分解</strong>：责任方是素材生产者的聚合标识（团队、供应商、自动生成管道）。这一层分解是回流到流程改造的抓手——某条自动生成管道的违规率显著高于人工素材时，问题在模板或提示词而不在审核。</p>\n<p><strong>时延指标</strong>：从违规发生到被发现的时间（mean time to detect）、从发现到处置的时间（mean time to remediate）。这两个指标经常比违规率本身更能反映系统的健康度，因为它们是「你多久能发现、多久能修」的直接度量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE compliance_patrol_finding (&#10;  id           BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  found_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  source       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  market       CHAR(2) NOT NULL,&#10;  channel      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  asset_id     BIGINT,&#10;  offer_id     BIGINT,&#10;  severity     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_id      TEXT,&#10;  rule_version TEXT,&#10;  detail       JSONB NOT NULL,&#10;  occurred_at  TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  resolved_at  TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  resolution   TEXT&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_patrol_market_sev&#10;  ON compliance_patrol_finding (market, severity, found_at DESC);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compliance_patrol_finding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  found_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  asset_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  offer_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  severity     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  detail       JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurred_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolved_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolution   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_patrol_market_sev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compliance_patrol_finding (market, severity, found_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>occurred_at</code> 与 <code>found_at</code> 的差就是发现时延，<code>resolved_at</code> 与 <code>found_at</code> 的差是处置时延。<code>source</code> 字段支撑按来源分解。这张表的设计目标不是记录全部巡检明细，而是记录<strong>全部违规发现</strong>——正例的明细可以采样，违规发现不能丢。</p>\n<h3 id=\"回流到规则修订\">回流到规则修订</h3><p>巡检结果的价值在于改变系统，而不是生成报告。三条回流路径：<strong>规则缺口</strong>（某类问题反复出现但从未被任何规则命中，说明词库或分类器有缺口，需要新增规则）、<strong>规则误判</strong>（告警级命中量异常高而申诉率也高，说明规则的上下文条件过窄，需要放宽）、<strong>流程缺口</strong>（违规都发生在某条绕过路径上，说明闸门的挂载点有遗漏）。</p>\n<p>回流要走第三章第三篇的规则版本管理流程，而不是直接改线上规则：新规则作为新版本发布，走灰度，观察拦截率与申诉率再推进全量。这样一次错误的规则修订不会立即影响全部市场。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH recent AS (&#10;  SELECT source, severity, occurred_at, found_at, resolved_at&#10;  FROM compliance_patrol_finding&#10;  WHERE found_at &gt;= now() - INTERVAL &#39;7 days&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT source,&#10;       COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE severity = &#39;block&#39;)     AS blocks,&#10;       COUNT(*)                                        AS total,&#10;       AVG(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (found_at - occurred_at)))    AS mttd_sec,&#10;       AVG(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (resolved_at - found_at)))    AS mttr_sec&#10;FROM recent&#10;GROUP BY source&#10;ORDER BY blocks DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source, severity, occurred_at, found_at, resolved_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compliance_patrol_finding</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> found_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> severity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'block'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blocks,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(EXTRACT(EPOCH </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (found_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> occurred_at)))    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mttd_sec,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(EXTRACT(EPOCH </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (resolved_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> found_at)))    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mttr_sec</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blocks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询给出按来源分解的一周概览，三个数字对应三种行动：<code>blocks</code> 高的来源要查规则缺口，<code>mttd_sec</code> 高的来源要提巡检频率，<code>mttr_sec</code> 高的来源要查处置流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>已发布内容的合规状态是时间相关的：前价窗口在滚动、规则在升级、渠道会缓存与改动，一次通过不等于永久通过。巡检与发布闸不可互相替代。</li>\n<li>检查分四类：内部价格比对（全量、高频）、内部规则重放（规则发布时、全量）、外部页面取数（加权抽样、每日）、全渠道价格抽查（分层抽样、每周），四者发现的问题类型不同。</li>\n<li>抽样按风险加权：新素材、高风险放行素材、曾有违规的责任方，抽样率更高。</li>\n<li>规则升级后的存量处理用重放解决，优化方式是只重放新旧规则的差集；命中阻断规则且仍在展示的素材应立即进待复核队列并考虑自动降级展示止损。</li>\n<li>落地页一致性是一类独立违规，来源常跨系统；三个高频不一致是折扣率口径不同、宣称未同步、落地页有素材没有的隐藏条件（实质性信息遗漏）。</li>\n<li>违规率必须按来源、严重度、责任方分解，并配合发现时延与处置时延；加权违规率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_w = \\sum_s w_s V_s / N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 可压缩成单值但不可替代分解。</li>\n<li>巡检结果走三条回流路径（规则缺口、规则误判、流程缺口），且必须经 <a href=\"../claim-rule-engine-gate/claim-rule-version-market\">规则版本与按市场覆盖</a> 的版本流程发布，不得直接改线上规则。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"促销合规监控与巡检","id":"促销合规监控与巡检"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"内部比对与外部取数","id":"内部比对与外部取数"},{"level":3,"text":"规则重放：规则升级后的存量处理","id":"规则重放-规则升级后的存量处理"},{"level":2,"text":"落地页一致性","id":"落地页一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"违规率指标","id":"违规率指标"},{"level":3,"text":"回流到规则修订","id":"回流到规则修订"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"宣称依据/实证留存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-claim-promo-compliance/claim-governance-risk/claim-substantiation-evidence"},"next":null}